      "rkaf:assertsPredicate": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:choice_text",
      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "The prohibition applies in any of three alternative situations: (1) when performance of inspection has begun before entering a sterile area or boarding an aircraft screened under this subchapter; (2) when entering or in a sterile area; or (3) when attempting to board or onboard an aircraft screened under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23.",
