      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\",\"(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\",\"(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4fa024f52e7db0c0787deeab4b06289b1a231c6ee6a7b3b3b5b11ee13668fcf2\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:b8d6607ff1882e660e2ec79ac74ec5328bab3aa982ee1a186ffdb717532ebb31\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:e468717e77755db3de9285cf95ad58ef94a8d24b3780827620561dd707bd538f\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:7b44ebea8e75f1647cd006fb6b9d09f3f4e66f1aa38540cac0e1832d301b74ce\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1efd420214a134b885820f534914c730ad7f72efd77ff3ae20746a27997c2caa\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:69925c1800dfbe1abb70b1ef1204d69b4f11af3588f1e1ed3e688dc49cb3e439\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:811ddf6be9c31af60892bd64dabff410764aa3556835da17bfb9004c32bc8864\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4c5f79cd70dab0715294b05fb01148a0f246b6405107016abae7a7feb283a2ba\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:783b4d3fe414d1207312c8201ec32e7b641ec3d19112e5bcffce12d74000a764\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"choice_text\":\"The prohibition applies in any of three alternative situations: (1) when performance of inspection has begun before entering a sterile area or boarding an aircraft screened under this subchapter; (2) when entering or in a sterile area; or (3) when attempting to board or onboard an aircraft screened under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":327,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":327,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:327:sha256-a32c8dfb7196d8707007190b60d5fd2a41cfc2faf3efbb1eecb19d61e6401457\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:769:sha256-f0b5b25a137f7cce76590536680b771afaf6acb0a5936dc368649100eb2ba93d\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":226,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:219:226:sha256-0007a8bea4dcd3f6b1490fc7199650f1046713dd92d9314e1f2ede6946fcd999\",\"quote\":\"may not\",\"start\":219},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:329:769:sha256-22dcfb8db4667ffae9d7a7b17b48ca968730412e4f33fe6a7d2d7577439d118b\",\"quote\":\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":329},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:769:sha256-f0b5b25a137f7cce76590536680b771afaf6acb0a5936dc368649100eb2ba93d\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":546,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:329:546:sha256-d5fe1a750d86ba4e476f3b755b0d6c324a6a6e30d69b292a6b13efb667ae044b\",\"quote\":\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\",\"start\":329},{\"end\":608,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:548:608:sha256-c139a639c1d605a7d307ad6a66eb81168e6c66c3a021b60c289053565aaa41c2\",\"quote\":\"(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\",\"start\":548},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:610:769:sha256-3303604764789bed72f78d4739f5fe14e317e2fcc6c61bed6be2c6efd864dead\",\"quote\":\"(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":610}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:27e130c31e88b014a8f71bb177cb797721d9b77e9187648314091d1655ac2433\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:783b4d3fe414d1207312c8201ec32e7b641ec3d19112e5bcffce12d74000a764\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"may not\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:85d874382c9bdd7c7bc71437347f47e0c5579480d388e5612ad5309702344cd6\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\",\"references\":[\"paragraph (b)\",\"§ 1544.201\",\"§ 1546.201\",\"§ 1562.23\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:c30c9f5fc7e3c242d7bfdd1e44e7dce68ce9f946cca40d3015ec5b27d75932a2\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\"],\"scope_text\":\"Applies except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section: (1) when performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter; (2) when the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or (3) when the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":85,\"summary\":\"Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary on or about the individual's person or accessible property when performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter, when entering or in a sterile area, or when attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
