    {
      "@id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:c21d6632ea3170ea8a3e8705c62c6c6b2f67e82df41ee1059729d5f4d540972a",
      "@type": "rkaf:Artifact",
      "rkaf:hasArtifactIdentifier": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:c21d6632ea3170ea8a3e8705c62c6c6b2f67e82df41ee1059729d5f4d540972a",
      "rkaf:artifactIdentifierScheme": "rkaf:urn-persistent",
      "rkaf:hasContentDigest": "sha256:4710746c3556e4f3c64146e4a5ecfe1b6a3ab94360658f0611ee355cf8e9742b",
      "dcterms:format": "application/json",
      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\",\"(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\",\"(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4cdced310d3171727656723ea6b8f6482516d787ad13d6caa96949350bd9e4fd\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c033c52c27fb652e74fad9d4613135eb024d82d2fab18efad0b55164ad655ab4\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:656311759e361643ba619cf8bef79743fcdd7917e9d9bbe2bd0bc5b78ac9d419\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:d8f17b49b97e4e2d3dc17b7d11ab3c50439caf1929b572ef12bae4437498898c\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:337fc843806ea3c86718323c3cdc19cf4ebda9a6b28cc7e416c6c64b2f1b1cb5\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3a1ce19b465954d93268c2d88bcfd6f1a71d83b36eb6ee55e2ba512410c7d037\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:b25dad60ca153e655c01ab5d20330fd46786893a30b8c34400458826e6ae5242\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:28401df92575f0da99d35dab21652e2095798170c92f09eea0d3670c606698b4\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4274e9da5ce30c3341cb71d5ad6fc3848edb877cdff0caad01c58ddf57c785b8\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"choice_text\":\"The individual must be one of the following: (1) law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport; (2) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter; or (3) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\"],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":988,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":988,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:988:sha256-9b176610a451fc252606e5feec7a890a0e3330de336680f39d2efb15eb504cc3\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":988,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:988:sha256-9b176610a451fc252606e5feec7a890a0e3330de336680f39d2efb15eb504cc3\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":900,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:886:900:sha256-533232681eac9dd2c357af3b24908d4c4e8d41562c911ad7ed51eb0f4638ccd0\",\"quote\":\"does not apply\",\"start\":886},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:769:sha256-f0b5b25a137f7cce76590536680b771afaf6acb0a5936dc368649100eb2ba93d\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":1129,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:990:1129:sha256-f63ba4358ff966ac514283f276f0c32e86dfc525ab2beea862985bb4ee9e53da\",\"quote\":\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\",\"start\":990},{\"end\":1282,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1131:1282:sha256-9ab3e271d6219176b18a908e1e89635a5cbfeb67fd6a395dd3bcf59d3ad942c1\",\"quote\":\"(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\",\"start\":1131},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1284:1374:sha256-767b73a5ca31a741e65fb7e179b443fe99e4fac4dbe40a0ca0c7e7df93cee56a\",\"quote\":\"(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":1284}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:c21d6632ea3170ea8a3e8705c62c6c6b2f67e82df41ee1059729d5f4d540972a\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"exemption\",\"logic_text\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4274e9da5ce30c3341cb71d5ad6fc3848edb877cdff0caad01c58ddf57c785b8\",\"modality\":\"not_required\",\"modality_quote\":\"does not apply\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:f1057000ba335756b5bf42641b0591537d40bfaf1aa1bd00ec10536957117e05\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"references\":[\"paragraph (a)\",\"§ 1544.219\",\"§ 1544.221\",\"§ 1544.223\",\"§ 1546.211\",\"part 1562, subpart B\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:0a3b86ee6c803bdef85f4f97a6a1d72eb8681c968117013ffe02835c869ba113\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\"],\"scope_text\":\"Applies to carriage of firearms and other weapons on an individual's person or accessible property if the individual meets one of three specified criteria.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":771,\"summary\":\"Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is: (1) law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport; (2) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter; or (3) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
